  "description": {
    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "Location, location! 60 seconds from the beautiful white sandy beach of the Emerald Coast, no elevators or parking lots here! Unit is located next to Deer Lake State Park assuring a very private beach. You won't believe the view from all three decks. <br><br>The townhome includes covered parking for two vehicles, large living room, dining room, kitchen with snack bar, and bathroom on 1st floor. The living room offers beautiful and modern leather furniture with recliner and full thickness pull out bed. TV is 77\" flat screen. The 2nd floor offers two on-suites. The primary suite includes flat screen TV, two large closets and a king-sized memory foam bed, master bath and beautiful deck overlooking the beach and ocean. <br>The second suite consists of a queen-sized foam mattress bed, oversized bunk beds, sleeping loft, modern deck and full bathroom with shower & tub. The large deck overlooks the Deer Lake State Park neighborhood. There is a wonderful laundry room with brand new clothes washer and dryer on the second floor where you need them. Built in closets make your stay even better than home.<br><br>The townhouse is 10 steps from a private and gated dunes walk-over leading to the beautiful white sandy beach, clear water, amazing surf, swimming in warm and shallow waters, dolphin watching, great fishing, surfing, and gorgeous sunsets. Door locks are digital for easy entry for your party.<br>For your safety and comfort, the entire property is gated. <br>Keywords: Townhome, Condo, Beachfront.",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
          ],
